[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":168},"routes/content-page",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"page",{"_14":35,"_20":27,"_36":7,"_37":38,"_39":40,"_16":41,"_42":43,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_18":48,"_49":50,"_9":51},"related",[11,12,13],{"_14":30,"_16":31,"_18":32,"_20":15},{"_14":24,"_16":25,"_18":26,"_20":27},{"_14":15,"_16":17,"_18":19,"_20":15},"slug","help","title","Help Centre","seo",{"_16":21,"_22":23},"area","Help Centre and FAQ | holidayfinder","description","Answers about booking, payment plans, changes and cancellations, holidayfinder®Flex, baggage, transfers, car rental and special assistance.","terms-of-sale","Terms of sale",{"_16":28,"_22":29},"legal","Terms of sale | holidayfinder","The booking terms for holidays, flights, stays, cars, events and cruises bought from holidayfinder: payment, changes, cancellation and your protection.","flex","holidayfinder®Flex",{"_16":33,"_22":34},"holidayfinder®Flex: cancel for any reason | holidayfinder","Cancel for any reason up to 24 hours before departure and get 90% of your trip price back. How Flex works, what it costs and what it covers.","cancellation-policy","kind","toc",true,"placeholder","Sample legal text for the white-label template. The store's own lawyers must replace it before launch; it is not legal advice.","Cancellation policy","lead","How to cancel a booking, what it costs and when you get your money back. The terms of your own offer always come first.","published","2026-03-01","updated","2026-10-28",{"_16":166,"_22":167},"sections",[52,53,54,55,56,57,58,59],[30,24,15],{"_60":149,"_16":150,"_63":151},{"_60":122,"_16":93,"_123":124,"_63":125},{"_60":114,"_16":115,"_63":116},{"_60":110,"_16":87,"_63":111},{"_60":100,"_16":101,"_63":102},{"_60":30,"_16":96,"_63":97},{"_60":70,"_16":71,"_63":72},{"_60":61,"_16":62,"_63":64},"id","cancellations-by-us","If we or a supplier cancel","blocks",[65],{"_66":67,"_68":69},"type","paragraph","text","If we cancel your booking, or a supplier cancels a service, we will tell you as soon as possible and offer an alternative where we can. If you don’t accept it, you get a full refund within 14 days. Your rights for packages are set out in our [Terms of sale](/info/terms-of-sale).","refunds","Refunds",[73,74],{"_66":76,"_77":78,"_79":80,"_81":82},{"_66":67,"_68":75},"Refunds go back to the payment methods you used. If you split the payment, each card or person gets back their own share.","table","caption","When to expect your refund","columns",[94,95],"rows",[83,84,85,86],[93,92],[91,92],[89,90],[87,88],"Flights","As soon as the airline refunds us, usually within 30 days","Hotels, cars and events","14 days of the supplier confirming","Flex cancellations","14 days of cancelling","Package holidays","Booking","Refund within","If you added Flex",[98],{"_66":67,"_68":99},"With [holidayfinder®Flex](/info/flex), you can cancel the whole booking for any reason up to 24 hours before departure and get 90% of the trip price back. The Flex fee and the remaining 10% are not refunded. Flex cancels the booking for everyone travelling.","cars-events-cruises","Cars, events and cruises",[103],{"_66":104,"_105":106},"list","items",[107,108,109],"**Car rental**: most rentals can be cancelled for free up to 48 hours before pick-up. The rental terms on each offer say exactly when.","**Event tickets**: tickets are usually non-refundable unless the event is cancelled. If it is, you get a refund for the tickets.","**Cruises**: cancellation is free at first. The deposit becomes non-refundable closer to departure and further charges rise up to departure, as shown in the cruise’s terms.","flights",[112],{"_66":67,"_68":113},"Flights follow the airline’s fare rules, shown on the offer under Flight terms. Many fares are non-refundable; some allow changes for a fee. If you cancel a non-refundable flight, you can usually still claim back the airport taxes — ask our support team.","hotels","Hotels and stays",[117],{"_66":104,"_105":118},[119,120,121],"**Free cancellation rates**: cancel for free until the date and time shown on the offer and in your confirmation. After that, the hotel’s charge applies — usually the first night or the full stay.","**Non-refundable rates**: cheaper, but you don’t get money back if you cancel or don’t arrive.","**Partly refundable rates**: the offer shows how much you get back and until when.","package-holidays","intro","For a flight and hotel booked together, the charge depends on how many days before departure you cancel.",[126,127],{"_66":76,"_77":129,"_79":130,"_81":131},{"_66":67,"_68":128},"If a flight in your package is non-refundable once booked, its cost may be charged in full at any time. The offer shows this before you book.","Sample cancellation charges for package holidays",[147,148],[132,133,134,135,136],[145,146],[143,144],[141,142],[139,140],[137,138],"13 days or less, or no-show","100% of the holiday price","27 to 14 days before","75% of the holiday price","41 to 28 days before","50% of the holiday price","56 to 42 days before","30% of the holiday price","More than 56 days before departure","Your deposit","When you cancel","Charge per person","how-to-cancel","How to cancel",[152,153,154],{"_66":104,"_161":38,"_105":162},{"_66":67,"_68":160},{"_66":155,"_156":157,"_16":158,"_68":159},"callout","status","warning","Your offer’s terms always apply","Your offer’s own terms always apply: they’re shown on the offer and in your confirmation. Where they differ from this page, the offer’s terms are the ones that count.","Prefer to talk to someone? Our support team can cancel for you, 24/7 — see [Contact us](/info/contact-us). A cancellation takes effect on the day we receive it.","ordered",[163,164,165],"Open [My bookings](/account/bookings), or [find your booking](/find-booking) with your booking reference and email address.","Choose the booking and select Cancel booking. You will see what you get back before you confirm.","Confirm the cancellation. We email you straight away with the refund amount and the date to expect it.","Cancellation policy | holidayfinder","How to cancel a holidayfinder booking, the charges for holidays, hotels, flights, cars, events and cruises, Flex, and how long refunds take.",{"_169":170},"store",{"_60":171,"_172":171,"_173":174,"_175":176,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_18":183,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_27":188,"_189":190,"_191":192,"_193":194,"_195":196},"holidayfinder","name","currency","EUR","site",{"_953":954,"_955":956},"engine",{"_949":950,"_951":952},"footer",{"_767":865,"_866":867,"_238":868,"_869":870,"_871":872,"_27":873,"_874":875},"theme",{"_810":811,"_812":813,"_814":815,"_816":817,"_818":819,"_820":821,"_822":823},{"_801":802,"_22":803,"_804":805},"menu",{"_767":768},"preferences",{"_719":720,"_721":722,"_723":724,"_725":174},{"_717":718,"_234":235},"home",{"_219":220,"_221":222,"_223":224,"_225":226,"_227":228,"_229":230},"support",{"_209":210,"_211":212,"_213":214,"_215":216},"paymentMethods",[205,206,207,208],"announcement",{"_197":198,"_199":200},"message","Flexible payment plans — pay in 3 instalments at no extra cost.","link",{"_201":202,"_203":204},"label","Learn more","href","/info/payment-options","card","paypal","googlepay","applepay","whatsappHref","https://wa.me/447700900123","phone",{"_201":217,"_203":218},"email","help@holidayfinder.example","hours","Every day, 24 hours","020 7946 0123","tel:+442079460123","campaign",{"_16":707,"_273":708,"_709":710,"_257":711},"inspiration",{"_16":699,"_105":700},"inspirationByMode",{"_301":302,"_303":304,"_110":305,"_306":307,"_308":309,"_310":311,"_312":313},"themes",[285,286,287,288],"trust",[268,269,270,271],"newsletter",{"_16":231,"_232":233,"_234":235,"_236":237,"_238":239},"Deals and travel inspiration","subtitle","Weekly in your inbox, daily in your feed","privacyHref","/info/privacy-and-cookies","destinations",[250,251,252,253],"social",[240,241,242],{"_243":248,"_203":249},{"_243":246,"_203":247},{"_243":244,"_203":245},"network","Facebook","https://www.fa